{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01436","headline":"相和歌辞 三洲歌 · 温庭筠","name":"相和歌辞 三洲歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"团圆莫作波中月，洁白莫爲枝上雪。\n月随波动碎潾潾，雪似梅花不堪折。\n李娘十六青丝发，画带双花爲君结。\n门前有路轻离别，惟恐归来旧香灭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01436.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01436","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}